WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:04.016
Lesson fifteen. Musical Instruments!

2
00:00:04.922 --> 00:00:12.055
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:13.048 --> 00:00:14.941
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.991 --> 00:00:18.831
Today we learn: Musical Instruments! Let's go!

5
00:00:20.226 --> 00:00:23.526
Drum! Say it with me. Drum!

6
00:00:27.548 --> 00:00:31.281
Guitar! Say it with me. Guitar!

7
00:00:35.257 --> 00:00:38.807
Piano! Say it with me. Piano!

8
00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:46.710
Violin! Say it with me. Violin!

9
00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:53.934
Flute! Say it with me. Flute!

10
00:00:57.915 --> 00:01:01.448
Trumpet! Say it with me. Trumpet!

11
00:01:05.463 --> 00:01:08.863
Sing! Say it with me. Sing!

12
00:01:12.907 --> 00:01:16.374
Music! Say it with me. Music!

13
00:01:20.389 --> 00:01:25.240
Listen. I can play the drum.

14
00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:28.550
Say it with me. I can play the drum.

15
00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:38.710
I like to play the drum and sing songs. My sister plays the piano beautifully.

16
00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:40.083
I like this story!

17
00:01:40.921 --> 00:01:46.239
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:46.289 --> 00:01:47.439
Piano!

19
00:01:48.508 --> 00:01:53.758
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:53.808 --> 00:01:54.958
Trumpet!

21
00:01:56.027 --> 00:02:02.253
Value corner: Empathy. Understanding how someone else feels helps us be a good friend.

22
00:02:02.303 --> 00:02:03.867
I can show empathy too!

23
00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:11.778
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:11.828 --> 00:02:13.383
Bye-bye, friends!

